# Per-shard suite logs from the sharded runner. Kept out of the two dirs above
# on purpose: Playwright clears its own output directory at the start of every
# run, which unlinks a log the shell still holds open.
e2e/shard-logs/
# Graphify knowledge-graph output (local tooling)
graphify-out/

# Agent-harness skill packs installed per-project. These are generic
# design/frontend skills plus per-harness mirrors (they are symlinks into
# .agents/skills/), none of them netrunner-specific. Untracked before this
# entry; see the allowlist below for the ones that are tracked.
.pi/
.goose/
.grok/
.hermes/
.junie/
.claude/
skills-lock.json

# .agents/skills/ is an ALLOWLIST rather than a blanket ignore, so "only
# netrunner files live here" is enforced and not merely aspirational. The cost
# is one line per new skill -- deliberate, so a generic skill pack cannot drift
# back in unnoticed.
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/release-readiness-review/
!.agents/skills/testing-watchlist-ui/

# Design-tool surface snapshots. One file here is already tracked; ignoring the
# directory leaves that tracked, and hides the generated ones.
.impeccable/

# Wrangler's local state/cache for the Linear webhook Worker.
ops/linear-webhook/.wrangler/
